# doctor7-onprem demo: settings of the nightly reset.
#
# Demo only. Do not install this on a production server.
#
# Each line has the form NAME=value. This file holds names only. Fill in the values on the demo
# host. The reset refuses to run while any of the first three is missing or wrong. Then run:
# systemctl enable --now doctor7-demo-reset.timer
#
# DEMO_MODE                 Must be exactly 1.
# DEMO_RESET_CONFIRM        Must be exactly erase-demo-data. It is set here and nowhere else.
# DEMO_RESET_DATABASE_URL   Connection URL of an account that may SELECT, INSERT, and DELETE in the
#                           demo database. It is not the URL of the API. The database name must end
#                           in _demo, or the reset refuses to run.
# NODE_BIN                  Optional. Path of a Node.js 22 or later, when it is not at
#                           /opt/node/current/bin/node and not in PATH.
#
# This file holds a credential. Keep its mode 0640 and its group doctor7-reset.
DEMO_MODE=
DEMO_RESET_CONFIRM=
DEMO_RESET_DATABASE_URL=
